# Mirrors hardwood-cron/.gitattributes. This repo had NO attributes file, so with
# core.autocrlf=true git was free to apply EOL conversion to published binaries —
# `git add` on the PDF tree emitted "LF will be replaced by CRLF" on ~190 files.
# The bytes on disk are currently intact, but a fresh clone or checkout could mangle
# every published PDF, and a corrupted download is indistinguishable from a working
# one until a reader opens it.
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
